**Evaluating commit hash problem**

The progress log must reference the latest commit hash, but including it in the commit creates a circular dependency. Updating progress after a commit would require another commit, changing the hash and causing stale references.
thinking
**Deciding to reference code commit hash in progress log**

The progress log will reference the main code commit hash before progress/log commits to avoid circular updates. The log update and subsequent commits are tracked separately, with tests and file changes noted in the entry.
